{"ref":"BDB, שִׁכֹּר","hw":"שִׁכֹּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכֹּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכּוֹר</span></big>  <strong>adj. drunken (</strong>Ba<sup>NB § 134 b</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.36\">1 S 25:36</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.9\">1 K 16:9</a> +, f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכֹּרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.13\">1 S 1:13</a>, pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכּוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:5\" href=\"/Joel.1.5\">Jo 1:5</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁכֹּרֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.1\">Is 28:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.3\">3</a>;—<em>drunken:</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:36\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.36\">1 S 25:36</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.9\">Je 23:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁתֶה שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 16:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.16.9\">1 K 16:9</a> <em>drinking</em> (and) <em>drunken</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 20:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.20.16\">20:16</a>; as subst. = <em>drunken one, drunkard</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.1\">Is 28:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.3\">3</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.9\">Pr 26:9</a>, pl. <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:5\" href=\"/Joel.1.5\">Jo 1:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁתֵי יַיִן</span>); in sim. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.14\">Is 19:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 12:25\" href=\"/Job.12.25\">Jb 12:25</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:27\" href=\"/Psalms.107.27\">ψ 107:27</a>, and (of earth) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 24:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.24.20\">Is 24:20</a>; f. of drunken woman <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.13\">1 S 1:13</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁכָּרוֹן","prev":"BDB, שֵׁכָר"}